  "description": "Entry point for the GB300 GPU boards. Carries a single dataset \u2014 racks currently carrying a GPU fault \u2014 with an exactly-matching detail table. All other GPU datasets are owned by the Coverage, Error surface and NVLink boards and are deliberately not repeated here.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "<div style=\"font:13px/1.55 Inter,Roboto,sans-serif;color:#c7d0d9\"><div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#e6edf3;margin-bottom:4px\">GPU Health &mdash; area home</div><div style=\"color:#8b98a5;margin-bottom:8px\">Entry point for the GB300 GPU boards. This page carries one dataset only: which racks are carrying a GPU fault right now. Every other GPU number lives on exactly one of the boards below, so nothing on this page is repeated anywhere else.</div><div style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#8b98a5\">GPU area&nbsp;&rsaquo;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#e6edf3;font-weight:600\">Area home</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/d/gpu-health/?${__url_time_range}\" style=\"color:#6ea8fe;text-decoration:none\">Coverage &middot; thermal &middot; power &middot; clocks</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/d/gpu-errors/?${__url_time_range}\" style=\"color:#6ea8fe;text-decoration:none\">Error surface &mdash; ECC &middot; XID &middot; violations</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/d/gpu-nvlink-health/?${__url_time_range}\" style=\"color:#6ea8fe;text-decoration:none\">NVLink &amp; bandwidth</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/d/nvis-dcgm-diag/?${__url_time_range}\" style=\"color:#6ea8fe;text-decoration:none\">Readiness checks</a></div></div>",
        "mode": "html"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "A rack counts once here if any GPU in it is reporting an XID, has a non-zero volatile or aggregate ECC or remapped-row counter, has fewer than 18 NVLink ports, or has a tray with nvidia-imex inactive. The table beside it is built from the identical expression \u2014 its row count equals this number.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "dark-red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.1.4",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "count(count by(rack, su) (DCGM_FI_DEV_XID_ERRORS{cluster=~\"$cluster\", datahall=~\"$datahall\", su=~\"$su\", rack=~\"$rack\", node=~\"$node\"}) or count by(rack, su) (max by(node, gpu, rack, su) (DCGM_FI_DEV_ECC_DBE_VOL_TOTAL{cluster=~\"$cluster\", datahall=~\"$datahall\", su=~\"$su\", rack=~\"$rack\", node=~\"$node\"}) > 0 or max by(node, gpu, rack, su) (DCGM_FI_DEV_ECC_SBE_VOL_TOTAL{cluster=~\"$cluster\", datahall=~\"$datahall\", su=~\"$su\", rack=~\"$rack\", node=~\"$node\"}) > 0 or max by(node, gpu, rack, su) (DCGM_FI_DEV_ECC_DBE_AGG_TOTAL{cluster=~\"$cluster\", datahall=~\"$datahall\", su=~\"$su\", rack=~\"$rack\", node=~\"$node\"}) > 0 or max by(node, gpu, rack, su) (DCGM_FI_DEV_ECC_SBE_AGG_TOTAL{cluster=~\"$cluster\", datahall=~\"$datahall\", su=~\"$su\", rack=~\"$rack\", node=~\"$node\"}) > 0 or max by(node, gpu, rack, su) (DCGM_FI_DEV_CORRECTABLE_REMAPPED_ROWS{cluster=~\"$cluster\", datahall=~\"$datahall\", su=~\"$su\", rack=~\"$rack\", node=~\"$node\"}) > 0 or max by(node, gpu, rack, su) (DCGM_FI_DEV_UNCORRECTABLE_REMAPPED_ROWS{cluster=~\"$cluster\", datahall=~\"$datahall\", su=~\"$su\", rack=~\"$rack\", node=~\"$node\"}) > 0) or count by(rack, su) (count by(node, gpu, rack, su) (su1_nvlink_up{cluster=~\"$cluster\", datahall=~\"$datahall\", su=~\"$su\", rack=~\"$rack\", node=~\"$node\"}) < 18) or count by(rack, su) (su1_service_active{service=\"nvidia-imex\", cluster=~\"$cluster\", datahall=~\"$datahall\", su=~\"$su\", rack=~\"$rack\", node=~\"$node\"} == 0)) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Racks carrying at least one GPU fault",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 18,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "<div style=\"font:13px/1.7 Inter,Roboto,sans-serif;color:#c7d0d9;padding:2px 4px\"><div style=\"font-weight:600;color:#e6edf3;margin-bottom:6px\">What counts as a GPU fault on this page</div><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:2px 18px 2px 0;color:#8b98a5\">XID</td><td>any <code>DCGM_FI_DEV_XID_ERRORS</code> series present &mdash; DCGM emits it only for an active XID. No codes excluded.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:2px 18px 2px 0;color:#8b98a5\">ECC / remap</td><td>volatile or aggregate SBE/DBE, or correctable/uncorrectable remapped rows, greater than zero.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:2px 18px 2px 0;color:#8b98a5\">NVLink</td><td>a GPU enumerating fewer than 18 NVLink ports.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:2px 18px 2px 0;color:#8b98a5\">IMEX</td><td><code>nvidia-imex</code> not active on a tray in the rack. Per-tray IMEX detail is owned by the <a href=\"/d/nvis-nvlink-downlanes/?${__url_time_range}\" style=\"color:#6ea8fe;text-decoration:none\">NVLink Downlane Map</a>.</td></tr></table><div style=\"margin-top:8px;color:#8b98a5;font-size:12px\">Per-GPU detail for each column is on the <a href=\"/d/gpu-errors/?${__url_time_range}\" style=\"color:#6ea8fe;text-decoration:none\">Error surface</a> and <a href=\"/d/gpu-nvlink-health/?${__url_time_range}\" style=\"color:#6ea8fe;text-decoration:none\">NVLink</a> boards.</div></div>",
        "mode": "html"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Built from the same four selectors as the stat above, unioned by rack \u2014 the row count equals it exactly. A blank cell means that fault class is clean on that rack.",
      "fieldConfig": {
